// # Aerospace & Deep Space Propulsion Unified Facade
//
// Logline: Master aerospace facade re-exporting chemical rocket engines, electric ion thrusters, nuclear propulsion, orbital mechanics, and entry aerothermodynamics.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim and unified API importing all 49 companion submodules in space_propulsion.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular chemical, electric, nuclear, fluid feed, staging, trajectory, and hypersonic aerocapture submodules.
//   2. Re-export public propulsion engine configurations, mission solvers, and numerical analysis shims.
//   3. Maintain full backwards compatibility and uniform type access for openOODA aerospace applications.

